# =============================================================================
# GO AND KEGG ENRICHMENT OF MOUSE-ORTHOLOG GENE LIST FROM THE OPPOSITE REGULATION TABLE
# =============================================================================
# Corrections in this version:
# - added Sex to the edgeR design (~ 0 + Group + Sex), with metadata validation,
#   full-rank checking, and explicit contrast-construction validation;
# - updated sex-adjusted expected reversal counts (46 total; 34 torpor-upregulated;
#   12 torpor-downregulated) while preserving strict_expected_counts as a switch;
# - changed GO/KEGG thresholds to 1% and explicitly filters final tables on
#   finite p.adjust < 0.01 before CSV output, plotting, and summary counts;
# - renamed reversal classes to torpor-upregulated and torpor-downregulated and
#   removed hard-coded gene counts from output filenames;
# - added one-sided Fisher overlap tests for enrichment of each reversal class,
#   with BH correction across the two class tests;
# - preserved the per-gene audit table, explicit tested Entrez universe checks,
#   input validation, RDS output, and sessionInfo().
#
# ASSUMPTION: the metadata sex column is named exactly "Sex" (case-sensitive).
# ASSUMPTION for Fisher tests: class-specific expected overlaps are calculated
# from the observed directional significant-set marginals. See Section 8.

